---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {site} from '../data/catalog';
---
<Layout title="Accessibility" description="Accessibility features and how to report a reading or navigation problem to Public Domain Pulp."><header class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A site for readers</p><h1>Accessibility.</h1></header><article class="editorial wrap"><p>We want the books and this website to be easy to discover and read. The site uses readable live text, keyboard-accessible navigation, labeled forms, visible focus indicators, and responsive layouts.</p><p>Book covers are also identified in text. Motion respects your device’s reduced-motion preference. Newsletter signup has a direct Substack link alongside the embedded form.</p><h2>Tell us about a problem</h2><p>If something makes the site difficult to use, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a> or use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Please tell us the page, what you were trying to do, and any browser or assistive technology details you wish to share.</p><p>External retailers, Spotify and Substack manage their own interfaces. We provide direct links so you can use those services separately.</p></article></Layout>
